{
  "declaredLength": 4732,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매만 있으면\n어떤 도넛도 만들 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B9CC0020C788C73CBA74000AC5B4B5A40020B3C4B11BB3C40020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안샤의 도넛 가게에서는\n나무열매의 조합으로 맛이 결정돼요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C0E4C7580020B3C4B11B0020AC00AC8CC5D0C11CB294000AB098BB34C5F4B9E4C7580020C870D569C73CB85C0020B9DBC7740020ACB0C815B3FCC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구멍이 있는 도넛은\n튀길 때 열이 골고루 전달돼요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CBA4DC7740020C788B2940020B3C4B11BC740000AD280AE380020B54C0020C5F4C7740020ACE8ACE0B8E80020C804B2ECB3FCC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도넛 구멍을 통해서 세상을 보면\n뭔가 보이는 게 있지 않을까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B11B0020AD6CBA4DC7440020D1B5D574C11C0020C138C0C1C7440020BCF4BA74000ABB54AC000020BCF4C774B2940020AC8C0020C788C9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 도넛 반죽을 만드는 걸 좋아해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020B3C4B11B0020BC18C8FDC7440020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC780020C88BC544D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "발효 여부에 따라서도\n도넛의 식감이 달라져요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC1CD6A80020C5ECBD80C5D00020B530B77CC11CB3C4000AB3C4B11BC7580020C2DDAC10C7740020B2ECB77CC838C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호텔Z 안의 작은 가게!\n안샤의 도넛 가게입니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638D154005A0020C548C7580020C791C7400020AC00AC8C0021000AC548C0E4C7580020B3C4B11B0020AC00AC8CC785B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 미르 조사의 핵심!\n안샤의 도넛 가게입니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B9740020C870C0ACC7580020D575C2EC0021000AC548C0E4C7580020B3C4B11B0020AC00AC8CC785B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후파가 좋아하는 도넛 가게 랭킹 1위!\n안샤의 도넛 가게입니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D30CAC000020C88BC544D558B2940020B3C4B11B0020AC00AC8C0020B7ADD0B900200031C7040021000AC548C0E4C7580020B3C4B11B0020AC00AC8CC785B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안샤의 컨디션은 완벽해요!\n어떤 도넛이든 만들어 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C0E4C7580020CEE8B514C158C7400020C644BCBDD574C6940021000AC5B4B5A40020B3C4B11BC774B4E00020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어서 옵쇼!\n...초밥 요리사를 흉내 내 봤어요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C635C1FC0021000A002E002E002ECD08BC250020C694B9ACC0ACB97C0020D749B0B40020B0B40020BD24C5B4C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알로라지방의 말라사다도\n도넛의 일종이에요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CB85CB77CC9C0BC29C7580020B9D0B77CC0ACB2E4B3C4000AB3C4B11BC7580020C77CC885C774C5D0C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도넛의 고리를\n세상에 널리 퍼뜨리고 싶어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B11BC7580020ACE0B9ACB97C000AC138C0C1C5D00020B110B9AC0020D37CB728B9ACACE00020C2F6C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금까지 수많은 도넛을 만들어 왔지만\n앞으로도 더 많이 만들고 싶어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08AE4CC9C00020C218B9CEC7400020B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020C654C9C0B9CC000AC55EC73CB85CB3C40020B3540020B9CEC7740020B9CCB4E4ACE00020C2F6C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가파워를 감당할 수 있는\n최고의 도넛을 만들어 볼게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00D30CC6CCB97C0020AC10B2F9D5600020C2180020C788B294000ACD5CACE0C7580020B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCFCAC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매는 4개까지 사용할 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B29400200034AC1CAE4CC9C00020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매는 5개까지 사용할 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B29400200035AC1CAE4CC9C00020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매는 6개까지 사용할 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B29400200036AC1CAE4CC9C00020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매는 7개까지 사용할 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B29400200037AC1CAE4CC9C00020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매는 8개까지 사용할 수 있어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B29400200038AC1CAE4CC9C00020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스파이시, 프레시, 스위트, 비터,\n그리고 사워, 어떤 맛을 만들어 볼까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D30CC774C2DC002C0020D504B808C2DC002C0020C2A4C704D2B8002C0020BE44D130002C000AADF8B9ACACE00020C0ACC6CC002C0020C5B4B5A40020B9DBC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCFCAE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도넛을 열심히 만들어 드릴 테니\n열심히 조사해 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B11BC7440020C5F4C2ECD7880020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B4DCB9B40020D14CB2C8000AC5F4C2ECD7880020C870C0ACD5740020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "버터를 가열해서\n녹인 버터로 만들어 둘게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC84D130B97C0020AC00C5F4D574C11C000AB179C7780020BC84D130B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B458AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도넛을 한 번에 잔뜩 만들어 두면\n호텔Z에 자주 돌아오지 않아도 돼서 편해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B11BC7440020D55C0020BC88C5D00020C794B7290020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B450BA74000AD638D154005AC5D00020C790C8FC0020B3CCC544C624C9C00020C54AC544B3C40020B3FCC11C0020D3B8D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매를 곱게 갈아서\n부드럽게 만드는 게 비결이에요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020ACF1AC8C0020AC08C544C11C000ABD80B4DCB7FDAC8C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC8C0020BE44ACB0C774C5D0C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르의 도넛에는\n설탕이 잔뜩 들어 있지 않나요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C7580020B3C4B11BC5D0B294000AC124D0D5C7740020C794B7290020B4E4C5B40020C788C9C00020C54AB098C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 도넛과 후파의 힘으로\n조사를 서포트할게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020B3C4B11BACFC0020D6C4D30CC7580020D798C73CB85C000AC870C0ACB97C0020C11CD3ECD2B8D560AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마음에 드는 효과를 발휘하는\n나무열매의 조합을 찾아 보세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C74CC5D00020B4DCB2940020D6A8ACFCB97C0020BC1CD718D558B294000AB098BB34C5F4B9E4C7580020C870D569C7440020CC3EC5440020BCF4C138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실제로 도넛에 구멍은 존재하지 않지만\n있다고 인식하게 되는 게 재밌지 않나요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C81CB85C0020B3C4B11BC5D00020AD6CBA4DC7400020C874C7ACD558C9C00020C54AC9C0B9CC000AC788B2E4ACE00020C778C2DDD558AC8C0020B418B2940020AC8C0020C7ACBC0CC9C00020C54AB098C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고... 이차원 나무열매는\n정말 신기한 나무열매네요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0002E002E002E0020C774CC28C6D00020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B294000AC815B9D00020C2E0AE30D55C0020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B124C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플러스 레벨도\n신경 쓰는 게 좋아요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D50CB7ECC2A40020B808BCA8B3C4000AC2E0ACBD0020C4F0B2940020AC8C0020C88BC544C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "든든 에너지가 적을수록\n조사 시간도 짧아지게 돼요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E0B4E00020C5D0B108C9C0AC000020C801C744C218B85D000AC870C0AC0020C2DCAC04B3C40020C9E7C544C9C0AC8C0020B3FCC694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우두머리를 만나기 쉬워지는\n도넛도 만들어 보고 싶어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B450BA38B9ACB97C0020B9CCB098AE300020C26CC6CCC9C0B294000AB3C4B11BB3C40020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "색이 다른 포켓몬을 만나기 쉬워지는\n도넛도 좋을 것 같아요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C9C7740020B2E4B9780020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020B9CCB098AE300020C26CC6CCC9C0B294000AB3C4B11BB3C40020C88BC7440020AC830020AC19C544C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플레이버 랭크가 높을수록\n도넛의 효과도 강해져요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D50CB808C774BC840020B7ADD06CAC000020B192C744C218B85D000AB3C4B11BC7580020D6A8ACFCB3C40020AC15D574C838C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스위트한 도넛은\n후파도 좋아해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4C704D2B8D55C0020B3C4B11BC740000AD6C4D30CB3C40020C88BC544D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스위트한 도넛은\n색이 다른 포켓몬에게 인기 있을 것 같아요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4C704D2B8D55C0020B3C4B11BC740000AC0C9C7740020B2E4B9780020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8C0020C778AE300020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C544C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스위트한 도넛으로는\n운과 관련된 효과를 얻을 수 있을 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4C704D2B8D55C0020B3C4B11BC73CB85CB294000AC6B4ACFC0020AD00B828B41C0020D6A8ACFCB97C0020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스파이시한 카레 도넛은\n호텔Z와 잘 어울리지 않나요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D30CC774C2DCD55C0020CE74B8080020B3C4B11BC740000AD638D154005AC6400020C7980020C5B4C6B8B9ACC9C00020C54AB098C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스파이시한 맛이 포켓몬의\n공격력을 높여 주는 걸까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D30CC774C2DCD55C0020B9DBC7740020D3ECCF13BAACC758000AACF5ACA9B825C7440020B192C5EC0020C8FCB2940020AC78AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스파이시한 도넛으로는\n공격에 유리한 효과를 얻을 수 있을 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D30CC774C2DCD55C0020B3C4B11BC73CB85CB294000AACF5ACA9C5D00020C720B9ACD55C0020D6A8ACFCB97C0020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후파는 사워 계열 도넛의\n살짝 새콤한 맛도 좋아해요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D30CB2940020C0ACC6CC0020ACC4C5F40020B3C4B11BC758000AC0B4C9DD0020C0C8CF64D55C0020B9DBB3C40020C88BC544D574C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매를 입수하기 쉬워지는 도넛으로\n나무열매를 잔뜩 모아 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020C785C218D558AE300020C26CC6CCC9C0B2940020B3C4B11BC73CB85C000AB098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020C794B7290020BAA8C5440020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사워한 도넛으로는\n도구와 관련된 효과를 얻을 수 있을 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC6CCD55C0020B3C4B11BC73CB85CB294000AB3C4AD6CC6400020AD00B828B41C0020D6A8ACFCB97C0020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후파는 의외로\n비터한 맛도 좋아해요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D30CB2940020C758C678B85C000ABE44D130D55C0020B9DBB3C40020C88BC544D574C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특정 타입에 의한 데미지를\n줄일 수 있으면 좋지 않을까요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9C8150020D0C0C785C5D00020C758D55C0020B370BBF8C9C0B97C000AC904C77C0020C2180020C788C73CBA740020C88BC9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비터한 도넛으로는\n방어에 유리한 효과를 얻을 수 있을 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44D130D55C0020B3C4B11BC73CB85CB294000ABC29C5B4C5D00020C720B9ACD55C0020D6A8ACFCB97C0020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프레시한 도넛은\n후파의 미각을 자극해 줘요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D504B808C2DCD55C0020B3C4B11BC740000AD6C4D30CC7580020BBF8AC01C7440020C790ADF9D5740020C918C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 잡고 싶을 때는\n프레시한 도넛을 추천해요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C7A1ACE00020C2F6C7440020B54CB294000AD504B808C2DCD55C0020B3C4B11BC7440020CD94CC9CD574C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프레시한 도넛으로는\n포획과 관련된 효과를 얻을 수 있을 거예요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D504B808C2DCD55C0020B3C4B11BC73CB85CB294000AD3ECD68DACFC0020AD00B828B41C0020D6A8ACFCB97C0020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 효과를 가진 도넛이 만들어질지\n기대해 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020D6A8ACFCB97C0020AC00C9C40020B3C4B11BC7740020B9CCB4E4C5B4C9C8C9C0000AAE30B300D5740020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가도넛 대작전을 위한\n스페셜 도넛이에요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00B3C4B11B0020B300C791C804C7440020C704D55C000AC2A4D398C15C0020B3C4B11BC774C5D0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매를 듬뿍 넣은 도넛으로\n그란돈 씨를 만나러 가요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020B4ECBFCD0020B123C7400020B3C4B11BC73CB85C000AADF8B780B3C80020C528B97C0020B9CCB098B7EC0020AC00C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매를 잔뜩 사용한 도넛으로\n가이오가 씨를 만나러 가요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020C794B7290020C0ACC6A9D55C0020B3C4B11BC73CB85C000AAC00C774C624AC000020C528B97C0020B9CCB098B7EC0020AC00C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매를 아끼지 않고 만든 도넛으로\n레쿠쟈 씨를 만나러 가요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020C544B07CC9C00020C54AACE00020B9CCB4E00020B3C4B11BC73CB85C000AB808CFE0C7C80020C528B97C0020B9CCB098B7EC0020AC00C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "최고의 플라스마 딥이\n완성될 것 같아요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CACE0C7580020D50CB77CC2A4B9C80020B525C774000AC644C131B4200020AC830020AC19C544C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특이한 도넛을 만들어 보려고\n고민 중이신 건가요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9C774D55C0020B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4B824ACE0000AACE0BBFC0020C911C774C2E00020AC74AC00C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 나무열매의 조합으로도\n도넛을 만들어 보일게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020B098BB34C5F4B9E4C7580020C870D569C73CB85CB3C4000AB3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4C77CAC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 도넛을 만들지\n고민되시나 보네요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C9C0000AACE0BBFCB418C2DCB0980020BCF4B124C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고민할 시간에 이것저것\n도넛을 만들어 보는 것도 방법이에요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0BBFCD5600020C2DCAC04C5D00020C774AC83C800AC83000AB3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4B2940020AC83B3C40020BC29BC95C774C5D0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨, 굳어 버리신 거예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C0020AD73C5B40020BC84B9ACC2E00020AC70C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멍하니 있는 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨도\n괜찮은 것 같아요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4DD558B2C80020C788B294002000100002010000000020C528B3C4000AAD1CCC2EC7400020AC830020AC19C544C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도넛을 만드는 일은\n행복을 만드는 일이에요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4DCB2940020C77CC740000AD589BCF5C7440020B9CCB4DCB2940020C77CC774C5D0C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도넛을 만들 때는 기본을 지키는 것과\n정성을 담는 것이 중요해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B11BC7440020B9CCB4E40020B54CB2940020AE30BCF8C7440020C9C0D0A4B2940020AC83ACFC000AC815C131C7440020B2F4B2940020AC83C7740020C911C694D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬이 맛있어할 만한 도넛을\n정성을 다해 만들 거예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B9DBC788C5B4D5600020B9CCD55C0020B3C4B11BC744000AC815C131C7440020B2E4D5740020B9CCB4E40020AC70C608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음식 취향을 통해\n그 사람을 알 수 있다고 해요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74CC2DD0020CDE8D5A5C7440020D1B5D574000AADF80020C0ACB78CC7440020C54C0020C2180020C788B2E4ACE00020D574C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹는다는 것은\n인생의 기본이니까요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39B294B2E4B2940020AC83C740000AC778C0DDC7580020AE30BCF8C774B2C8AE4CC694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요리는 기본이 중요해요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694B9ACB2940020AE30BCF8C7740020C911C694D574C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "천천히 생각해 보세요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC9CCC9CD7880020C0DDAC01D5740020BCF4C138C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다리고 있을게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C744AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "동경하는 요리사는\n유명한 즈미 씨예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3D9ACBDD558B2940020C694B9ACC0ACB294000AC720BA85D55C0020C988BBF80020C528C608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    }
  ],
